      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "content": "### 🧭 Trazabilidad Distribuida de Extremo a Extremo (OpenTelemetry + Grafana Tempo)\n\nCada petición que ingresa por el **API Gateway** o los microservicios genera spans distribuidos interconectados.\n\n* **🚀 Explorar Trazas en Vivo por Servicio (1 Clic en Tempo Explore):**\n  * 🌐 [Buscar Trazas de **API Gateway**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22queryType%22:%22search%22,%22serviceName%22:%22api-gateway%22%7D%5D%7D)\n  * 📝 [Buscar Trazas de **Transaction Service**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22queryType%22:%22search%22,%22serviceName%22:%22transaction-service%22%7D%5D%7D)\n  * 🔐 [Buscar Trazas de **Auth Service**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22queryType%22:%22search%22,%22serviceName%22:%22auth-service%22%7D%5D%7D)\n  * 💼 [Buscar Trazas de **Wallet Ledger Service**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22queryType%22:%22search%22,%22serviceName%22:%22wallet-ledger-service%22%7D%5D%7D)\n  * 💱 [Buscar Trazas de **Exchange Rate Service**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22queryType%22:%22search%22,%22serviceName%22:%22exchange-rate-service%22%7D%5D%7D)\n\n* **💡 Visor de Cascada Interactivo abajo:** Muestra el flujo jerárquico de la traza cargada (puedes cambiar el ID en el campo `Trace ID a Inspeccionar` en la barra superior).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
